Warning [L0508]: this arrow loop body computes a value and drops it
  --> tests/ui_lint/arrow_loop_value_drop.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     loop v, values -> v * 2
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: a statement-position loop arrow discards its body's value; use a value loop to collect results or a write handle to update the source
 Fix: bind the loop with `::` to collect its values, or write `loop v, &values -> v *= 2` to update in place
